OL,3,GNEWSASwinney's #2 cap on bus fares
OL,4,Akicks in - but some call it half a
OL,5,Asolution
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Scottish government's policy to cap
OL,8,Fbus fares in the west of Scotland at #2
OL,9,Fhas taken effect.
OL,11,FFirst Minister John Swinney announced
OL,12,Fthe move as part of his programme for
OL,13,Fgovernment last week.
OL,15,FFrom Monday, the #2 trips are being
OL,16,Foffered in Glasgow, Renfrewshire,
OL,17,FAyrshire, Dunbartonshire, Lanarkshire
OL,18,Fand Inverclyde - part of a promise to
OL,19,Fcap fares across the whole of Scotland
OL,20,Fby the end of the parliamentary term.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
