OL,3,GNEWSASwinney's #2 cap on bus fares
OL,4,Akicks in - but some call it half a
OL,5,Asolution
OL,6,
OL,7,FA pilot of the scheme has already been
OL,8,Frolled out in the Highlands and
OL,9,Fislands, but Swinney has not said when
OL,10,Fit would be extended to the rest of the
OL,11,Fcountry.
